Childhood Emotional Neglect, or CEN happens when your parents fail to respond enough to your emotions as they raise you. This can leave you feeling misunderstood, empty and alone as you grow up, and through your adulthood.
Some of the most powerful words are those of real people sharing their stories. Here is a sampling of the real words of people who grew up with Childhood Emotional Neglect (CEN).
