Rowlett wrote that the City Council would be willing to help find ��a more amenable solution�� to the issue while reiterating that the proposed location was not a good fit.
��The Vacaville City Council urges you to reconsider your decision to locate the tiny homes pilot project on county property on Brown Street,�� he wrote.
